    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Nothing beats the thrill of battle... other than beating your friends of course!</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ever-changing arena as you go head to head with your friends online or on the same computer in a brutally hilarious mix of physics and skill based combat. Prove your might as you battle it out with <strong>over 15 weapons across 25 arena layouts</strong>. Reap the rewards of your conquest by collecting <strong>over 30 customization options</strong> so you can dance on the corpses of your enemies in style!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intended for 2 - 4 players</strong> For Blood and Glory is our love letter to chaotic party brawlers. Our goal was to take the hilarity of ragdoll physics and blend it with opportunities for player skill to shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Brutally Hilarious</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in over-the-top comedic mayhem as ragdoll gladiators stumble, slash, and slam their way to victory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Chaotically Replayable</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 25 arenas brims with hazards, traps, and shifting layouts\u2014ensuring that no two battles ever play out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Skill Meets Slaughter</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the physics may be wild, true champions know timing and precision reign supreme. Hone your skills across an arsenal of over 15 weapons including swords, spears, axes, hammers and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A Wardrobe For War</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reap the rewards of your conquests and deck out your gladiator with fierce new looks. With over 30 items to collect from menacing helmets to outlandish outfits, show off your spoils and dominate the arena in style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Nothing beats the thrill of battle... other than beating your friends of course!</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ever-changing arena as you go head to head with your friends online or on the same computer in a brutally hilarious mix of physics and skill based combat. Prove your might as you battle it out with <strong>over 15 weapons across 25 arena layouts</strong>. Reap the rewards of your conquest by collecting <strong>over 30 customization options</strong> so you can dance on the corpses of your enemies in style!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intended for 2 - 4 players</strong> For Blood and Glory is our love letter to chaotic party brawlers. Our goal was to take the hilarity of ragdoll physics and blend it with opportunities for player skill to shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Brutally Hilarious</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in over-the-top comedic mayhem as ragdoll gladiators stumble, slash, and slam their way to victory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Chaotically Replayable</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 25 arenas brims with hazards, traps, and shifting layouts\u2014ensuring that no two battles ever play out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Skill Meets Slaughter</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the physics may be wild, true champions know timing and precision reign supreme. Hone your skills across an arsenal of over 15 weapons including swords, spears, axes, hammers and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A Wardrobe For War</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reap the rewards of your conquests and deck out your gladiator with fierce new looks. With over 30 items to collect from menacing helmets to outlandish outfits, show off your spoils and dominate the arena in style.</p>",
